{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Child stories created (all `story`, priority 2, tags `complexity-reduction` + `breaking-pass-4`, parent this epic; cites on origin/main 083620b0):\n\n- **S1** `gunshy-symmetric-barnacle` (`bf96-5776-6a97-420f`) — Move the reconciler to `rebar.reconciler` and delete every by-path loader (package move, `_loader.py` + all `lazy_load`/`spec_from_file_location`/`sys.path.insert` sites gone, `engine_env` drops PYTHONPATH, 6 complexity-baseline keys re-spelled). depends_on: none.\n- **S2** `emblematic-apostolic-mouse` (`4b2a-e417-30ed-4f3a`) — Delete the test-side engine-root machinery and rename `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler` to `tests/unit/reconciler` (`_engine_path.py`, `_one_engine_root`, shadow bridge, root-convention tests deleted; 29 mechanism-baseline keys re-spelled + `--update-stale`). depends_on: `gunshy-symmetric-barnacle`.\n- **S3** `unadhesive-caloric-sapsucker` (`f75f-5d85-7b9a-4d86`) — Add `run_guarded_pass` as the one guarded core for the CLI, library and MCP `bridge_sync` (bug fix: library/MCP live pass now takes the lock, heartbeats, honors pause, publishes last-pass from the disposition). depends_on: `gunshy-symmetric-barnacle`.\n- **S4** `chippable-potty-dipper` (`cfbd-97a9-ff1d-4945`) — Spawn `python -m rebar.reconciler` directly from `_bridge_runner` and reap the process group on timeout (`MODE_ARGS`, `_spawn_bounded`, `start_new_session`, engine child owns exit codes). depends_on: `unadhesive-caloric-sapsucker`.\n- **S5** `captious-tangled-pigeon` (`fc96-b268-b737-4b8b`) — Delete the three retired `REBAR_RECONCILER_*` rollback toggles and make fail-loud unconditional (`CREATE_ROUTE`, `WRITE_FACADE`, `FAIL_SILENT_NOOP`; `--update-stale` for the three `env_var` rows). depends_on: `emblematic-apostolic-mouse`.\n- **S6** `senile-especial-herring` (`115f-4b98-3df5-48f7`) — Delete the dormant summary-executor, payload-shadow and `_concurrency` modules and the dead half of `outbound_fields` (typed-only `applier.apply`, explicit 10-pair `_VALID_COMBINATIONS`). depends_on: `captious-tangled-pigeon`.\n- **S7** `paper-ionic-ugandakob` (`ad8a-38e7-44d3-4662`) — Retire `_call_with_retry` so handlers make a single transport attempt (ADR 0103 S3; `ticket_plans` required, legacy `remaining` loop deleted). depends_on: `senile-especial-herring`.\n- **S8** `cob-portable-springbok` (`e6ee-ae52-8e5d-4917`) — Move reconciler scratch from `bridge_state/` to `.rebar/bridge/` with keep-last-N retention (`scratch_retention.py`, prune on persisted pass: 5 snapshots / 5 sync logs / 30 alert days). depends_on: `emblematic-apostolic-mouse`.\n\nEvery story carries a recorded file impact. S1 has an implementation-detail first comment (line cites, the six baseline keys, the `sys.modules` inventory, release note) plus the operator-sanction comment; S2 carries the mechanism-ratchet comment (deleted autouse fixtures + `tests/_engine_path.py` helper) plus the operator-sanction comment; S5 carries the mechanism-ratchet comment (the three env vars)."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788807774684230994,"uuid":"09cd7286-2171-4728-bb04-61e83af30577"}